    \ | 0.873 | 0.684 | 1.000 | 0.991 | 0.023 | 0.780 |\n| 1092 | 1 | MNN Correction with Gaussian Kernel Smoothing | Axiom I | 710 | 0.5769 | 0.687 | 0.561 | 0.236 | 0.375 | 0.874 | 0.724 | 0.234 | 0.991 | 0.173 | 0.915 |\n| 1091 | 1 | Hybrid v4: Latent Standardization + MNN Residual Correction | Axiom I | 709 | 0.4697 | 0.411 | 0.538 | 0.216 | 0.368 | 0.830 | 0.629 | 0.000 | 0.990 | 0.000 | 0.716 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
    \ lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
