    \ | 0.248 | 0.288 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.787 |\n| 1122 | 1 | Combat-PCA with Zero-Variance Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 760 | 0.6236 | 0.596 | 0.748 | 0.207 | 0.249 | 0.909 | 0.690 | 1.000 | 0.984 | 0.109 | 0.744 |\n| 1121 | 1 | Ridge probe: Euclidean metric in DAQB (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 759 | 0.7327 | 0.725 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.306 | 0.977 | 0.691 | 1.000 | 0.966 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n| 1120 | 1 | Ridge probe: tighten inbound cap to 1.80 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 759 | 0.7405 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.315 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.791 |\n| 1119 | 1 | Ridge micro-sweep: GraphFWPCA feature-weighting alpha_g=0.40 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 755 | 0.7389 | 0.756 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.966 | 0.713 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1118 | 1 | Combat-PCA Baseline Integration | Syntellect I | 754 | 0.6210 | 0.596 | 0.748 | 0.207 | 0.285 | 0.908 | 0.689 | 1.000 | 0.984 | 0.109\
