    \ (ID: 1131) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6395122335046182\n**ASW_batch:** 0.648\n**ASW_label:** 0.235\n**ARI:** 0.686\n**NMI:** 0.730\n**Graph_conn:** 0.887\n**kBET:** 0.835\n**iLISI:** 0.135\n**cLISI:** 0.991\n**PCR:** 0.875\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.371\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.648  ASW_label: 0.235  ARI: 0.686  NMI: 0.730\n  Graph_conn: 0.887  kBET: 0.835  iLISI: 0.135  cLISI: 0.991\n  PCR: 0.875  Cell_cycle: 0.371\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.825516  ASW_label: 0.547551  ARI: 0.686204  NMI: 0.730062\n  Graph_conn: 0.888753  kBET: 0.796368  iLISI: 0.135486  cLISI: 0.997454\n  PCR: 0.874963  Cell_cycle: 0.325612\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration\
    \ ===\nEnsemble with Adaptive Alpha (Steeper Sigmoid k=10): Starting...\n  [Stage 2] Computing global and local embeddings...\n  [Stage 3] Calculating adaptive alpha using steep sigmoid (k=10)...\n  [Stage 4] Fusing embeddings with cell-specific alpha...\n✓ Adaptive Ensemble (Steeper Sigmoid) complete.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: False\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/1e9076bf-5b22-46ab-bb16-e51ad55f1ce2/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 1e9076bf-5b22-46ab-bb16-e51ad55f1ce2\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Steeper Sigmoid, k=10)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1131.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID |\
    \ Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1132 | 1 | Batch-aware feature weighting × GraphFWPCA @ Ridge (bafw_beta=0.50) | Praxis IV | 772 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1131 | 1 | Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Steeper Sigmoid, k=10) | Axiom I | 771 | 0.6395 | 0.686 | 0.648 | 0.235 | 0.371 | 0.887 | 0.730 | 0.875 | 0.991 | 0.135 | 0.835 |\n| 1130 | 1 | BBKNN Graph-Based Integration Baseline | Syntellect I | 770 | 0.5836 | 0.491 | 0.676 | 0.223 | 0.294 | 0.888 | 0.681 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.056 | 0.540 |\n| 1129 | 1 | Quota-Preserving Ensemble (directed) @ Ridge: union-by-frequency\
    \ with per-batch quotas | Praxis IV | 768 | 0.7341 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.851 | 0.733 | 1.000 | 0.992 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n| 1128 | 1 | Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Sigmoid Mapping) | Axiom I | 767 | 0.6370 | 0.687 | 0.651 | 0.234 | 0.372 | 0.892 | 0.731 | 0.899 | 0.992 | 0.116 | 0.797 |\n| 1127 | 1 | Ensemble Correction with Adaptive Alpha (Density-based) | Axiom I | 766 | 0.6349 | 0.681 | 0.651 | 0.234 | 0.372 | 0.888 | 0.727 | 0.903 | 0.992 | 0.109 | 0.793 |\n| 1126 | 1 | Aletheia I - Internal ASW_label/ARI Diagnostic (Anscombe vs Log1p, Fixed Tags) | Aletheia I | 766 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1125 | 1 | Ensemble DAQB (3 seeds) @ Ridge: union-topK (binary) with min-distance tie-break | Praxis IV | 765 | 0.7363 | 0.778 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.881 | 0.790 |\n| 1124 | 1 | Combat-PCA with 150 Components and Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 764 | 0.6385 | 0.603 | 0.781 | 0.196 | 0.284 | 0.927 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.146\
    \ | 0.796 |\n| 1123 | 1 | Ridge-lean verification: k=48 (kd=22, δ=0.10, λ=0.605, α_g=0.50, seed=0) | Praxis IV | 764 | 0.7382 | 0.773 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.288 | 0.966 | 0.728 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.787 |\n\nPage 1 of 114 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-114, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
