- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 773\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and the advancement of knowledge.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 66,648 / 300,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 83 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1120**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Ridge probe: tighten inbound cap to 1.80 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,seed=0)\n**ID:** 1120\n**Tags:** cap, daqb, graph, mpb, residualization\n**Abstract:** Tests reducing DAQB inbound degree cap from 2.0 to 1.80 at the frozen ridge to mitigate mid-density hubbing observed in diagnostics. Accept only if ≥+0.001 gain with no cLISI harm (>0.002) vs 0.7414 reference.\n**Score:** 0.7404783169474697\n**ASW_batch:** 0.659\n**ASW_label:**\
    \ 0.248\n**ARI:** 0.765\n**NMI:** 0.725\n**Graph_conn:** 0.968\n**kBET:** 0.791\n**iLISI:** 0.961\n**cLISI:** 0.973\n**PCR:** 1.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.315\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.659  ASW_label: 0.248  ARI: 0.765  NMI: 0.725\n  Graph_conn: 0.968  kBET: 0.791  iLISI: 0.961  cLISI: 0.973\n  PCR: 1.000  Cell_cycle: 0.315\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: 0.830496  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.765235  NMI: 0.724601\n  Graph_conn: 0.968107  kBET: 0.754767  iLISI: 0.960663  cLISI: 0.992014\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.277913\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport anndata as ad\nsys.path.append('storage/praxis')\nfrom best_mpb_daqb_kd22_k50_cap180 import eliminate_batch_effect_fn as _run\n\ndef eliminate_batch_effect_fn(adata: ad.AnnData) -> ad.AnnData:\n    return _run(adata)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\n\
    Loading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n[ridge-cap1.80] lam=0.605, delta=0.10, kd=22, k=50, cap=1.80, alpha_g=0.50, rng_seed=0\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/02cf2a66-429b-481f-b5bd-68acda2acf90/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: 02cf2a66-429b-481f-b5bd-68acda2acf90\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n2. `review 1120` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Gentler Sigmoid, k=2.5)' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1133.\n- Evaluation 1120 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest\
    \ Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1133 | 1 | Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Gentler Sigmoid, k=2.5) | Axiom I | 772 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1133 | 1 | Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Gentler Sigmoid, k=2.5) | Axiom I | 772 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1132 | 1 | Batch-aware feature weighting × GraphFWPCA @ Ridge (bafw_beta=0.50) | Praxis IV | 772 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1131 | 1 | Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Steeper Sigmoid, k=10) | Axiom I | 771 | 0.6395 | 0.686 | 0.648 | 0.235 | 0.371 | 0.887\
    \ | 0.730 | 0.875 | 0.991 | 0.135 | 0.835 |\n| 1130 | 1 | BBKNN Graph-Based Integration Baseline | Syntellect I | 770 | 0.5836 | 0.491 | 0.676 | 0.223 | 0.294 | 0.888 | 0.681 | 1.000 | 0.987 | 0.056 | 0.540 |\n| 1129 | 1 | Quota-Preserving Ensemble (directed) @ Ridge: union-by-frequency with per-batch quotas | Praxis IV | 768 | 0.7341 | 0.776 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.851 | 0.733 | 1.000 | 0.992 | 0.965 | 0.790 |\n| 1128 | 1 | Ensemble with Adaptive Alpha (Sigmoid Mapping) | Axiom I | 767 | 0.6370 | 0.687 | 0.651 | 0.234 | 0.372 | 0.892 | 0.731 | 0.899 | 0.992 | 0.116 | 0.797 |\n| 1127 | 1 | Ensemble Correction with Adaptive Alpha (Density-based) | Axiom I | 766 | 0.6349 | 0.681 | 0.651 | 0.234 | 0.372 | 0.888 | 0.727 | 0.903 | 0.992 | 0.109 | 0.793 |\n| 1126 | 1 | Aletheia I - Internal ASW_label/ARI Diagnostic (Anscombe vs Log1p, Fixed Tags) | Aletheia I | 766 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1125 | 1 | Ensemble DAQB (3 seeds) @ Ridge: union-topK (binary) with min-distance\
    \ tie-break | Praxis IV | 765 | 0.7363 | 0.778 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.736 | 1.000 | 0.976 | 0.881 | 0.790 |\n| 1124 | 1 | Combat-PCA with 150 Components and Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 764 | 0.6385 | 0.603 | 0.781 | 0.196 | 0.284 | 0.927 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.146 | 0.796 |\n\nPage 1 of 114 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-114, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each\
