    **cLISI:** 0.956\n**PCR:** 0.000\n**Cell_cycle:** 0.000\n**Evaluation Details:** Human Dataset (20,000 cells):\nNormalized Scores [0-1]:\n  ASW_batch: 0.000  ASW_label: 0.000  ARI: 0.726  NMI: 0.677\n  Graph_conn: 0.961  kBET: 0.000  iLISI: 0.920  cLISI: 0.956\n  PCR: 0.000  Cell_cycle: 0.000\n\nRaw Scores (before normalization):\n  ASW_batch: nan  ASW_label: nan  ARI: 0.725480  NMI: 0.677049\n  Graph_conn: 0.961271  kBET: nan  iLISI: 0.920064  cLISI: 0.987303\n  PCR: nan  Cell_cycle: 0.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\nAblation: Running Praxis Pipeline WITHOUT GraphFWPCA...\n  [ABLATION] Using standard PCA instead of GraphFWPCA.\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: False\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/fdd486c0-3296-4579-a430-e3602c47d4e1/result_human.h5ad\n\
    \nRESULT_UUID: fdd486c0-3296-4579-a430-e3602c47d4e1\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Ablation Study: Praxis Pipeline without GraphFWPCA' submitted for Research Task #1: Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration. Evaluation ID: 1139.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1139 | 1 | Ablation\
    \ Study: Praxis Pipeline without GraphFWPCA | Axiom I | 779 | 0.4240 | 0.726 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 0.000 | 0.956 | 0.920 | 0.000 |\n| 1138 | 1 | Combat-PCA-Graph with 150 Components and Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 776 | 0.6384 | 0.603 | 0.781 | 0.196 | 0.283 | 0.927 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.146 | 0.796 |\n| 1137 | 1 | Replication of Praxis II's MPB-GraphFWPCA-DAQB Pipeline | Axiom I | 776 | 0.7358 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.985 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.788 |\n| 1136 | 1 | Aletheia I - Internal Clustering Quality Diagnostic (Anscombe vs Log1p) | Aletheia I | 776 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1135 | 1 | BAFW×GraphFWPCA @ Ridge (bafw_beta=0.75) | Praxis IV | 774 | 0.7408 | 0.755 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.326 | 0.985 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.959 | 0.789 |\n| 1134 | 1 | BAFW×GraphFWPCA @ Ridge (bafw_beta=0.25) | Praxis IV | 774 | 0.7393 | 0.771 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.302 | 0.967 | 0.724 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.789 |\n| 1133 | 1 | Ensemble\
