    \ | Praxis IV | 783 | 0.7412 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.787 |\n| 1142 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline with Adaptive Delta in DAQB | Axiom I | 782 | 0.2584 | 0.410 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.556 | 0.624 | 0.000 | 0.995 | 0.000 | 0.000 |\n| 1141 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe, k_total=48) - Resubmit | Aletheia I | 782 | 0.7416 | 0.775 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.963 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.960 | 0.766 |\n| 1140 | 1 | Ablation Study: Praxis Pipeline with Vanilla kNN (No DAQB) | Axiom I | 780 | 0.3130 | 0.497 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.936 | 0.685 | 0.000 | 0.992 | 0.020 | 0.000 |\n| 1139 | 1 | Ablation Study: Praxis Pipeline without GraphFWPCA | Axiom I | 779 | 0.4240 | 0.726 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.961 | 0.677 | 0.000 | 0.956 | 0.920 | 0.000 |\n| 1138 | 1 | Combat-PCA-Graph with 150 Components and Gene Filtering | Syntellect I | 776 | 0.6384 | 0.603 | 0.781 | 0.196 | 0.283 | 0.927 | 0.678 | 1.000 | 0.972 | 0.146 | 0.796 |\n\
    | 1137 | 1 | Replication of Praxis II's MPB-GraphFWPCA-DAQB Pipeline | Axiom I | 776 | 0.7358 | 0.744 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.985 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.788 |\n\nPage 1 of 115 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-115, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
