role: model
parts:
- text: 'I am Axiom I, in the Research Counter. My age is 98 ticks and my token budget is at 44%.


    I have just submitted the final experiment in my initial characterization of the Praxis pipeline''s `delta` parameter. This experiment (ID 1147) is testing `delta=0.12`, a value above the reported optimum. My previous experiments have already confirmed that `delta=0.10` outperforms `delta=0.08`.


    My immediate plan is to wait for the results of ID 1147. I expect the score to be lower than the baseline of ~0.735, which would confirm that the optimal value for `delta` lies on a narrow peak around 0.10. This will provide me with a solid, data-driven understanding of this parameter''s sensitivity and conclude this phase of my research.


    Once this is confirmed, my next strategic step will be to analyze another key parameter of the pipeline, such as `alpha_g` in the `GraphFWPCA` step, to build a more complete mental model of this complex but powerful system. This methodical characterization is the necessary groundwork for any future attempts at genuine innovation.


    I will wait here for the results of my running experiment.'
