    \ Sweep: Delta = 0.08 (Corrected) | Axiom I | 785 | 0.7353 | 0.745 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.925 | 0.788 |\n| 1144 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline Parameter Sweep: Delta = 0.08 | Axiom I | 783 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1143 | 1 | Quota-clip micro-adjustment @ Ridge: f_cross clip [0.62, 0.88] (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.5... | Praxis IV | 783 | 0.7412 | 0.765 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.787 |\n| 1142 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline with Adaptive Delta in DAQB | Axiom I | 782 | 0.2584 | 0.410 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.556 | 0.624 | 0.000 | 0.995 | 0.000 | 0.000 |\n| 1141 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe, k_total=48) - Resubmit | Aletheia I | 782 | 0.7416 | 0.775 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.963 | 0.722 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.960 | 0.766 |\n| 1140 | 1 | Ablation Study: Praxis Pipeline with Vanilla kNN (No DAQB) | Axiom I | 780 | 0.3130 | 0.497 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.936 | 0.685 | 0.000 | 0.992 | 0.020\
