    \  ASW_label: 0.555112  ARI: 0.745544  NMI: 0.710254\n  Graph_conn: 0.997859  kBET: 0.752346  iLISI: 0.943866  cLISI: 0.990414\n  PCR: 0.999979  Cell_cycle: 0.287468\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: python storage/system/main.py\nLoading training dataset...\n  Data shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Batches: 4 batches\nFound eliminate_batch_effect_fn, executing...\n\n=== Running batch integration ===\n  Result shape: (20000, 2000)\n  Has embedding: True\n  Has graph: True\n\nResult saved to: storage/shared/tmp/b362559e-b41f-4ea0-96f2-6eba324fe27b/result_human.h5ad\n\nRESULT_UUID: b362559e-b41f-4ea0-96f2-6eba324fe27b\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
    | 1 | Single-cell RNA-seq Batch Integration |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | ARI | ASW_batch | ASW_label | Cell_cycle | Graph_conn | NMI | PCR | cLISI | iLISI | kBET |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1152 | 1 | Augmented PCA with Batch Features for KNN Graph | Syntellect I | 792 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1151 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline Parameter Sweep: alpha_g = 0.75 | Axiom I | 791 | 0.7387 | 0.746 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.998 | 0.710 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.944 | 0.788 |\n| 1150 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline Parameter Sweep: alpha_g = 0.25 | Axiom I | 790 | 0.7309 | 0.727 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.968 | 0.685 | 1.000 | 0.962 | 0.943 | 0.790 |\n| 1149 | 1 | Manual Batch-Aware Graph Integration (BBKNN-like) | Syntellect I | 789 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |\
    \  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1148 | 1 | Aletheia I - MNN Correction with Gaussian Kernel Smoothing (Anscombe Norm) | Aletheia I | 789 | 0.6062 | 0.788 | 0.581 | 0.241 | 0.402 | 0.861 | 0.740 | 0.356 | 0.992 | 0.269 | 0.833 |\n| 1147 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline Parameter Sweep: Delta = 0.12 | Axiom I | 787 | 0.7347 | 0.736 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.964 | 0.934 | 0.789 |\n| 1146 | 1 | Entropy-gated DAQB @ Ridge: gate=0.50, k_entropy=12 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 787 | 0.7401 | 0.760 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.714 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.963 | 0.789 |\n| 1145 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline Parameter Sweep: Delta = 0.08 (Corrected) | Axiom I | 785 | 0.7353 | 0.745 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.986 | 0.709 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.925 | 0.788 |\n| 1144 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline Parameter Sweep: Delta = 0.08 | Axiom I | 783 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1143 | 1 | Quota-clip micro-adjustment @ Ridge: f_cross clip [0.62, 0.88] (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.5...\
