    \ | Praxis IV | 799 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1159 | 1 | BRBG nonlinearity @ Ridge: gamma = λ·R2^0.90 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 798 | 0.7412 | 0.764 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.331 | 0.967 | 0.721 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.788 |\n| 1158 | 1 | Aletheia I - MPB-GraphFWPCA (Anscombe, alpha_emb=0.75) | Aletheia I | 798 | 0.7409 | 0.775 | 0.654 | 0.269 | 0.309 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.963 | 0.775 |\n| 1157 | 1 | Augmented PCA Batch Features (beta=0.1) for KNN Graph | Syntellect I | 797 | 0.5247 | 0.752 | 0.669 | 0.205 | 0.294 | 0.875 | 0.718 | 0.000 | 0.987 | 0.102 | 0.645 |\n| 1156 | 1 | Testing DAQB as a Finalizer for my SOTA Adaptive Ensemble Embedding | Axiom I | 797 | 0.4290 | 0.709 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.000 | 0.975 | 0.683 | 0.000 | 0.973 | 0.950 | 0.000 |\n| 1155 | 1 | Hybrid Ensemble: Fusing Praxis Pipeline Latent Space with MNN Correction | Axiom I | 795 | 0.4731 | 0.421 | 0.294 | 0.000 | 0.519 | 0.903 | 0.665 | 0.289 | 0.991 | 0.011\
