    \ | Praxis IV | 806 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1166 | 1 | Diagnostic Run: Praxis Pipeline (alpha_g=0.75) using Shared Suite (Corrected) | Axiom I | 805 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1165 | 1 | Diagnostic Run: Praxis Pipeline (alpha_g=0.75) using Shared Suite | Axiom I | 803 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1164 | 1 | λ micro-probe @ Ridge: lam=0.610 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 802 | 0.7398 | 0.759 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.717 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.960 | 0.787 |\n| 1163 | 1 | λ micro-probe @ Ridge: lam=0.600 (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,α_g=0.50,seed=0) | Praxis IV | 801 | 0.7363 | 0.733 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.967 | 0.706 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.789 |\n| 1162 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline with Adaptive Lambda in BRBG (Corrected) | Axiom I | 800 | 0.7375 | 0.743 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.327 | 0.997 | 0.703 | 1.000 | 0.967 | 0.939 | 0.791 |\n| 1161 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline with Adaptive Lambda in BRBG | Axiom I | 799 | n.a. |  |  |  |\
