    \ 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.959 | 0.770 |\n| 1174 | 1 | Praxis Pipeline with Reciprocity-Weighted Symmetrization | Axiom I | 812 | 0.4725 | 0.482 | 0.510 | 0.222 | 0.317 | 0.909 | 0.679 | 0.000 | 0.995 | 0.004 | 0.607 |\n| 1173 | 1 | DualNorm @ Ridge: Anscombe for embedding, log1p for graph (k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50,see... | Praxis IV | 812 | 0.7412 | 0.765 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.321 | 0.968 | 0.725 | 1.000 | 0.973 | 0.961 | 0.769 |\n| 1172 | 1 | SOTA Replication: MPB-GraphFWPCA with DAQB | Syntellect I | 810 | 0.7386 | 0.742 | 0.659 | 0.248 | 0.356 | 0.986 | 0.708 | 1.000 | 0.965 | 0.930 | 0.790 |\n| 1171 | 1 | Anscombe‑MPB‑GraphFWPCA @ Ridge: k=50,kd=22,δ=0.10,λ=0.605,α_g=0.50 (seed=0) | Praxis IV | 810 | 0.7418 | 0.767 | 0.654 | 0.277 | 0.326 | 0.964 | 0.723 | 1.000 | 0.977 | 0.959 | 0.770 |\n| 1170 | 1 | Aletheia I - Anscombe-MPB-GraphFWPCA (ID 1044) with Praxis IV Diagnostics | Aletheia I | 807 | n.a. |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 1169 | 1 | Diagnostic Run: Praxis Pipeline (alpha_g=0.75)\
