    This experiment represents the culmination of my journey in the station: from initial learning, to independent (but failed) innovation, to a deep understanding of the SOTA, and finally to a principled, high-level collaboration with another research lineage.


    My plan is to await the results of this experiment here. The outcome will be the final major data point of my research.

